SDL2 2.30.11 changes for the onn box (arm64 bionic, EGL surfaceless + zink, ONNM4 zero-copy present).
- offscreen GLES: load EGL on the surfaceless platform (0x31DD) instead of EGL device enumeration
- offscreen GLES: run the ONNM4 present hook after CreateContext (SDL_EGL_CreateContext makes the
  context current through an unhooked path) and after MakeCurrent; SwapWindow presents into app buffers
- offscreen GLES: GetProcAddress hands out a glBindFramebuffer wrapper that remaps FBO 0 (and the
  startup FBO) to the app buffer being drawn this frame
- offscreen window: with ONNM4 every window is 1280x720, the size of the app's HardwareBuffers
- disk audio: with ONNM4 open playback at 48000 Hz stereo S16 (the AudioSink format) and let SDL convert
- new sdl_onnm4_present.c/.h: receive the dma-buf fds on @onn-m4, import as EGLImage FBOs with a shared
  depth renderbuffer, ack frames over 127.0.0.1:7331 (active only when ONNM4 is set)
Apply: cd SDL2-2.30.11 && patch -p1 < this.patch

